    "shots": [
      {
        "id": "silence",
        "scene": "launch",
        "look": "obsidian",
        "intent": "silence",
        "targetFrames": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "awakening",
        "scene": "launch",
        "look": "obsidian",
        "intent": "detailed_description: [Shot 1] At 00:00.000 almost total black. A single delicate cool-white grazing reflection slowly awakens the curved ivory shell of one earbud, occupying the right two-thirds with clean black negative space at left. The actual product is stationary and suspended without supports. A very slow 100 mm macro camera tracks along the shell; its shallow focus moves from the precise hairline shell seam to the tiny woven black oval mesh. [Shot 2] At 00:04.000 an elegant hard cut to an extreme oblique macro across the dark silicone ear tip, showing its fine soft satin edge and recessed black speaker mesh. One narrow silver light strip glides across the material, then reveals a little more of the ivory body. Cold top rim, near-black underside, controlled specular highlights, no white clipping. At the end pull back slightly to read one complete earbud suspended on black. The shape stays solid and unchanged. Cinematography is calm, precise and mysterious. No text, no exploded views, no circuitry, no people.",
        "targetFrames": 144
      },
      {
        "id": "suspension",
        "scene": "launch",
        "look": "obsidian",
        "intent": "detailed_description: [Shot 1] At 00:00.000 a pair of the exact ivory short-stem earbuds float separately in a deep black void, one front three-quarter view and the other inner three-quarter view with charcoal tips. The left sits slightly higher, the right lower. They slowly drift 5 cm apart while the camera smoothly dollies around them by only 15 degrees; no spinning. Narrow cool softbox reflections travel across their sculpted forms, with deep controlled shadows and only a restrained cold blue edge. [Shot 2] At 00:04.000 cut to their matching CLOSED ivory charging case floating below the pair in a very wide clean black environment. The tiny front indicator glows white once. The camera descends gently to place the case below and behind the floating earbud pair, keeping shapes and proportions identical to the reference. Finish with an orderly balanced three-object hero tableau. No pedestal, no surface, no cables, no duplicate buds, no text, no logo. Photographic physical materials, tight highlight control.",
        "targetFrames": 192
      },
      {
        "id": "sound-space",
        "scene": "launch",
        "look": "obsidian",
        "intent": "detailed_description: [Shot 1] At 00:00.000 extreme macro of the charcoal silicone ear tip and its recessed black speaker aperture from the exact product. A single fine silver ring forms INSIDE the dark aperture. The camera rushes forward through that opening at 00:01.500; the dark circle becomes a vast immersive three dimensional acoustic space in one seamless portal transition. [Shot 2] At 00:02.000 the camera flies between concentric elliptical wavefronts made of hair-thin silver and desaturated ice-blue light, with sparse suspended light points that react in precise waves. These are spatial sound wave sculptures in a truly deep black volume, not a neon tunnel or flat graphic. The earbud pair appears suspended in the calm center of this immense field, exactly the same ivory short-stem design with charcoal tips. Controlled parallax and acceleration give scale. At 00:06.000 wavefronts contract, light points extinguish, camera decelerates and all effects gently disappear into black, leaving ONLY two earbuds floating quietly at center. Finish on generous black space, delicate cold rim and softly lit warm ivory faces. No text, logo or people. Restrained and physically convincing, no saturated cyberpunk, no smoke storm.",
        "targetFrames": 192
      },
      {
        "id": "signature",
        "scene": "launch",
        "look": "obsidian",
        "intent": "signature",
        "targetFrames": 144
      }
    ],
